('Crown of Thorns', 'Euphorbia milii', 'Thorny succulent shrub with clusters of small bright bracts year-round. Tough and forgiving; blooms even in poor conditions.', 14, 'Let soil dry between waterings; very drought-tolerant.', 'Bright direct light', '60-85°F, low humidity, sandy well-draining mix', '{"winter_multiplier": 1.3}'),
